&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build full-stack end-to-end across the People Products portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement AI-native workflows: build tools, evals, prompts, and products.

